### Alle Mocktails
GET http://localhost:8080/mocktails

### Filtern nach Zutat
GET http://localhost:8080/mocktails?zutat=minze

### Einen Mocktail
GET http://localhost:8080/mocktails/1

### Anlegen -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/mocktails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shirley Temple",
  "beschreibung": "süß und fruchtig",
  "zubereitung": "Ginger Ale auf Eis, Grenadine dazu",
  "zutaten": [
    { "name": "Ginger Ale", "menge": 200, "einheit": "ml" },
    { "name": "Grenadine", "menge": 10, "einheit": "ml" }
  ]
}

### Ändern -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/mocktails/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shirley Deluxe",
  "beschreibung": "mit Kirsche",
  "zubereitung": "auf Eis",
  "zutaten": [ { "name": "Ginger Ale", "menge": 200, "einheit": "ml" } ]
}

### Löschen -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/mocktails/3

### Fehlerfall -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/mocktails
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "zutaten": [] }